# ASTRA UI theme

- Use `useTheme()` for programmatic colors (tab bar, charts, RefreshControl).
- Prefer NativeWind tokens: `bg-astra-bg`, `text-astra-text`, `border-astra-border` (CSS vars switch with `.dark` on root).
- Theme preference: `useThemeStore` + `preference-storage` (`astra_theme_mode`; SecureStore on native, sessionStorage on web).
- Reusable shells: `GlassCard`, `MetricCard`, `SectionTitle`, `QuickViewModalShell`.
- Keep dashboards clean: max 2 chart sections per screen, generous spacing (`gap-4`), no dense tables on mobile.
- References: dark = Nebula/ROBOYO (cyan/purple accents); light = Loop (white cards, soft shadow).
